text.body:
% collated with \msT = Tokyo University Library no. 517

jñānamūrtiṃ namaskṛtya sarvadṛṣṭividārakam |

svādhiṣṭhānaprabhedo 'yaṃ vakṣyate kṛpayā mayā || 1 ||

astīti kalpanā yāvat tāvac chāśvatakalpanā |

śāśvatābhiniveśo 'yaṃ nedaṃ māyāsvalakṣaṇam || 2 ||

nāstīti kalpanā yāvat tāvad ucchedakalpanā |

ucchedābhiniveśo 'yaṃ nedaṃ māyāsvalakṣaṇam || 3 ||

astināstitvanirmuktā madhyamā yā tu kalpanā |

madhyamābhiniveśo 'yaṃ nedaṃ māyāsvalakṣaṇam || 4 ||

yat satyaṃ samvṛtiḥ proktaṃ buddhānāṃ kāyalakṣaṇam |

seyaṃ māyā samuddiṣṭā svādhiṣṭhānam ihocyate || 5 ||

yena vyāptam idaṃ sarvaṃ trailokyaṃ sacarācaram |

yo nāpyate 'lpapuṇyais tu vyākṛtair eva labhyate || 6 ||

% vyākṛtair] \ed\emend, vyākṛter \ms

nātra śaucaṃ na niyamo na tapo na ca duṣkaram |

aduṣkarair aniyamaiḥ sukhair harṣaiś ca sidhyati || 7 ||

% harṣaiś] \ed\emend, hasaiś \ms

evaṃ vijñāya tattvajño yaṃ smarec ca muhur muhuḥ |

sidhyate tasya buddhatvaṃ sarvaṃ māyāvikurvitaiḥ || 8 ||

% sarvamāyā°] \conj

māyāsthaṃ ca sadā devāḥ pālayantīha yoginaḥ |

sarvajñeyaṃ bhavaty eva māyopamasamādhinā || 9 ||

vajrāyudhaṃ mahāvīryaṃ sarvam ārogyasatsukham |

% vajrāyuṣaṃ] \conj

buddhaṛddhiṃ ca samprāpya yāty utpatati svecchayā || 10 ||

vaśam āyānti sattvāś ca darśanenaiva coditāḥ |

labhate vāñchitaṃ sarvaṃ māyopamasamādhinā || 11 ||

svapnamāyopamān dharmān bauddhāḥ sarve vadanty api |

satyaṃ te na prajānanti svādhiṣṭhānabahirmukhāḥ || 12 ||

vāyuvijñānasaṃyuktaṃ chāyākāraṃ manomayam |

% chāyākāraṃ] \ed\emend, chāyākāra° \ms

svajñānaṃ te na paśyanti māyādṛṣṭāntamohitāḥ || 13 ||

% māyā°] \ed\conj, ø \ms

ananteṣv api kalpeṣu śrutipāraṅgatair api |

guruvaktrād vinā māyā sākṣātkartuṃ na śakyate || 14 ||

tasmān mānaṃ parityajya buddhatvaphalakāṅkṣayā |

vajrayānaṃ samāruhya yatnenārādhayed gurum || 15 ||

% ... samāruhya] incipit Tokyo [\msT 2\recto]

idānīṃ ca pravakṣyāmi kramabhedaṃ sudurlabham |

yaṃ jñātvā vicared yogī sarvabuddhamayo bhavet || 16 ||

pṛthivyādīni catvāri tathā śūnyacatuṣṭayam |

aṣṭau padārthā vijñeyā vināśotpattihetavaḥ || 17 ||

% \footnote{aṣṭau padārthā vijñeyā] \msT, (lacuna) \ed}

prabhāsvarān mahāśūnyaṃ tasmāc copāyasambhavaḥ |

tasmād utpadyate prajñā tasyāḥ pavanasambhavaḥ || 18 ||

pavanād agnisambhūtir agneś ca jalasambhavaḥ |

% \footnote{agner jalasamudbhavaḥ] \msT, agne[ś ca] jalasambhavaḥ \ed\emend, agne jalasambhavaḥ \ms}

jalāc ca jāyate pṛthvī sattvānām eṣa sambhavaḥ || 19 ||

% \footnote{eva] \msT, eṣa \ed}

bhūdhātur līyate toye toyas tejasi līyate |

tejaś ca sūkṣmadhātau ca vāyuś citte vilīyate || 20 ||

cittaṃ caitasike līyetāvidyāyāṃ tu caitasam |

% \footnote{līyed avidyāyāṃ] \emend, līyed aṃvidyāyāṃ \msT, līye vidyāyāṃ \ms}

% \footnote{caitasam] \ed\emend\msT, cetasam \ms}

sāpi prabhāsvaraṃ gacchen  nirodho 'yaṃ bhavatraye || 21 ||

% \footnote{sāpi] \ed\emend\msT, so 'pi \ms}

% \footnote{°trayam] \msT, °traye \ed}

anādikālikaṃ hy evaṃ bhavacakraṃ pravartate |

% \footnote{etad] \msT, evaṃ \ed}

yāvan na paśyaty ātmānaṃ māyopamasamādhinā || 22 ||

svasamvedyā hi sā māyā tārkikāṇām agocarā |

% \footnote{svasamvedya] \ed\emend\msT, svasamvedyo \ms}

% māyā [\msT 2\verso] tārkikāṇām

nijadehasthitau cāpi mandapuṇyair na labhyate || 23 ||

% \footnote{°sthitā] \msT, °sthitau \ed}

% \footnote{°puṇyair] \ed\emend\msT, °puṇyo \ms}

% \footnote{dṛśyate] \msT, labhyate \ed}

jñāyate param ekena svadehe sāvikāriṇī |

% sā'vikāriṇī \ed

gurupādaprasādena dṛṣṭāntair upalakṣitā || 24 ||

nidhayo maṇayaś cāpi pṛthivyām udakaṃ tathā |

% \footnote{caiva] \msT, cāpi \ed}

vidyamānā na dṛśyante tathā deheṣu sarvavit || 25 ||

māyāmarīcir gandharvanagaraḥ śakrakārmukam |

% \footnote{°marīci°] \msT, °marīcir \ed}

% \footnote{°nagaraṃ] \msT, °nagaraḥ \ed}

darpaṇapratibimbaś codakacandraḥ pratidhvaniḥ || 26 ||

% \footnote{darpaṇapratibimbaṃ] \msT, darpaṇapratibimbaś \ed\emend, darpaṇaḥ pratibimbaś \ms}

% \footnote{ca udakacandra°] \msT, codakacandraḥ \ed\emend, codakacandra \ms}

svapnamāyābhūpaṭalaṃ vidyudbudbudasaṃjñitā |

% \footnote{°cchāyābhra°] \corr, °cchāyā abhra° \msT, °māyābhū° \ed}

% \footnote{°saṃjitā] \ed, °saṃjñitāḥ \msT}

māyā dvādaśa dṛṣṭāntair vistarā caikalakṣaṇā || 27 ||

% \footnote{vistarāc] \msT, vistarā \ed}

āsāṃ vispaṣṭatārūpaṃ yad devatālambanaṃ prati |

% \footnote{vispaṣṭa°] \msT, vispaṣṭatā° \ed}

māyātrayaṃ samuddiṣṭaṃ yatnatas tat prakīrtyate || 28 ||

% \footnote{°trayaṃ] \msT\pcorr\ (\textit{secunda manu}) \ed, °yantraṃ \msT\acorr}

% \footnote{parikīrtyate] \msT, prakīrtyate \ed}

darpaṇapratibimbaṃ ca śakracāpam athāparam |

% \footnote{darpaṇa°] \ed, darpaṇaṃ \msT}

tṛtīyaṃ jalacandraṃ ca mūrtim etair vibhāvayet || 29 ||

% \footnote{°candraś ca] \msT\pcorr\ (\textit{secunda manu}), °candra \msT\acorr, °candraṃ ca \ed}

% \footnote{mūrtir] \msT, mūrtiṃ \ed}

sūtake yat samuddiṣṭaṃ yac ca buddhakulaṃ mahat |

% \footnote{pañca°] \msT, yac ca \ed}

tattatkulasamudbhūtā devatāś ca pṛthagvidhāḥ || 30 ||

% \footnote{tadvat tatkulasambhūtā] \msT, tattatkulasamudbhūtā \ed}

% [\msT 3\recto]

dūtadūtyas tathā krodhāś ceṭaceṭyaś ca kiṃkarāḥ |

% \footnote{dūtā] \msT, dūta° \ed}

% \footnote{ceṭyaś ceṭāś] \msT, ceṭaceṭyaś \ed}

na te santi na tāḥ santi sattvārthaṃ prati darśitāḥ || 31 ||

% \footnote{tāḥ] \ed\emend\msT, bhāḥ \ms}

etat sarvaṃ hared yogī saṃhared api cātmanā |

% \footnote{sphared] \msT, hared \ed}

% \footnote{yogī] \ed\emend\msT, yogi \ms}

māyopamasamādhistho maṇḍalādy api vistaram || 32 ||

% \footnote{maṇḍalād api] \msT, maṇḍalādy api \ed}

varṇān nānāvidhāṃś cāpi svādhiṣṭhānena yojayet |

% \footnote{varṇān] \ed, varṇāṃ \msT}

% \footnote{nānāvidhāṃś] \ed, nānāvidhāṃ \msT}

śokaṃ bhayaṃ virāgaṃ ca saṃtrāsaṃ skhalitaṃ tathā || 33 ||

% \footnote{virāgaś] \msT, virāgaṃ \ed}

% \footnote{saṃtrāsaḥ] \corr, saṃtrāsa \msT, saṃtrāsaṃ \ed}

duṣṭaṃ ca daurmanasyaṃ ca durdṛṣṭaṃ duṣkṛtaṃ tathā |

% \footnote{This line is in \ed, but not the \msT.}

durgandhaṃ dūrasaṃ cāpi duḥsparśaṃ caiva yad bhavet |

% \footnote{durgandhaṃ] \ed, durgandaṃ \msT}

% \footnote{dūrasaṃ] \ed, durasaṃ \msT}

% \footnote{caiva ... cāpi] \msT, cāpi ... caiva \ed}

% \footnote{duḥsparśaṃ] \ed, dusparśaṃ \msT}

tās tā virūpā prakṛtīḥ svādhiṣṭhānena śodhayet || 34 ||

% \footnote{prakṛtīḥ] \ed\emend\msT, prakṛtāṃ \ms}

viṇmūtrādipravṛttiś ca jvarādyā vyādhayaś ca ye |

% \footnote{°mūtrādi°] \ed, °mutrādi° \msT}

% \footnote{ye] \msT\pcorr, yo \msT\acorr}

svābhāvikā jarādyāś ca teṣāṃ māyā cikitsakam || 35 ||

% \footnote{jarādyāś] \msT\pcorr\ \ed, jvarādyāś \msT\acorr}

% \footnote{cikitsikā] \msT\pcorr\ (\textit{secunda manu}), cikittasikā \msT\acorr, cikitsitam \ed}

yena dharmeṇa bālānāṃ saṃsāro bhuvi vardhate |

yoginas tena dharmeṇa saṃsāro na vivardhate || 36 ||

% \footnote{sambhāro bhuvi vardhate] \msT, saṃsāro na vivardhate \ed}

% \ed points out that henceforth up to 55 are quoted in the 8th siddhi, 212-213

sukhāḥ kāmaguṇāḥ pañca bālānāṃ bandhane matāḥ |

yoginas tena dharmeṇa buddhatvaṃ sādhayet punaḥ || 37 ||

rāgo harṣas tathā prītir maitrī ca karuṇā tathā |

% \footnote{rāgaṃ] \conj, rāga \msT, rāgo \ed}

% \footnote{harṣaṃ] \msT, harṣas \ed}

% \footnote{tathā] \ed, sp?ṣā (?) \msT}

% \footnote{prītir maitrī] \ed, prīti mautrīṃ \msT}

% [\msT 3\verso]

upekṣā muditā caiva balam utsāha eva ca || 38 ||

śauryaṃ vīryaṃ tathā raudraṃ haṭhatvaṃ sāhasaṃ tathā |

% \footnote{raudryaṃ] \msT, raudraṃ \ed}

svarūpāḥ prakṛtīś cānyāḥ svādhiṣṭhānena saṃharet || 39 ||

% \footnote{saṃcaret] \msT, saṃharet \ed\ \emend, saṃcaret \ms}

ekamudrāsamāyuktaś caturmudrāyuto 'thavā |

% \footnote{catur°] \ed, catu° \msT}

antaḥpuragato vāpi svādhiṣṭhānam anusmaret || 40 ||

rūpaṃ śabdaṃ tathā gandhaṃ rasaṃ sparśaṃ ca śobhanam |

anubhūyāt sadā yogī mahāsukhapade sthitaḥ || 41 ||

% \footnote{°rāga°] \msT, °sukha° \ed}

tataṃ caivāvanaddhaṃ ca ghaṇṭaṃ śuṣiram eva ca |

% \footnote{ātataṃ vitataṃ caiva] \msT, tataṃ caivāvanaddhaṃ ca \ed}

% \footnote{ghanaṃ] \msT, ghaṇṭaṃ \ed}

vādyaṃ caturvidhaṃ yogī svādhiṣṭhānena nirviśet || 42 ||

% \footnote{nirdiśet] \msT, nirviśet \ed}

śṛṅgārādīn rasān sarvān nava navanāṭakasaṃjñakān |

% \footnote{rasān sarvān] \ed, rasān asasvan \msT}

% \footnote{nava nāṭyasamudbhavān] \msT, navanāṭakasaṃjñakān \ed}

anubhūyāt sadā yogī māyopamasamādhinā || 43 ||

% \footnote{anubhūyāt] \ed, anubhūyāt| \msT}

yogatantre samuddiṣṭāś chomādyā ye ca vistarāḥ |

% \footnote{samuddiṣṭāś] \ed, samuddiṣṭā \msT}

% \footnote{cchommādyā] \msT, chomādyā \ed}

tāṃś ca pravartayed yogī māyayānupalambhataḥ || 44 ||

% māyayā'nupalambhataḥ

unmiṣan nimiṣan vāpi hasan jalpaṃs tathaiva ca |

% \footnote{unmiṣaṃ nimiṣaṃ cāpi] \msT, uniṣan nimiṣan vāpi \ed}

% \footnote{jalpaṃs] \ed, jalpan \msT}

% \footnote{hi] \msT, ca \ed}

gacchaṃs tiṣṭhan svapan bhuñjan māyādeham anusmaret || 45 ||

% \footnote{gacchaṃs] \ed, gacchan \msT}

% tiṣṭhan [\msT 4\recto] svapan

% \footnote{svapan] \msT\pcorr\ \ed, svasvapan \msT\acorr}

jagaty anyāś ca yāḥ krīḍā nānāsaṃkalpakalpitāḥ |

% \footnote{yāḥ] \ed, yā \msT}

vicaret tāś ca tattvajño mahārāganaye sthitaḥ || 46 ||

% \footnote{tāsu] \msT, tāś ca \ed}

% \footnote{mahārāganaye] glossed \textit{secunda manu} in upper margin: \textit{sahaje}}; NB perhaps the term mahārāganaya was fading from fashion? also note variant mahāsukha° in 41d!

svādhiṣṭhānam idaṃ prāpya sarvadṛṣṭividāraṇam |

% \footnote{°vidālanam] \msT, °vidāraṇam \ed}

sarvaṃ kuryān na kuryād vā yathārucitaceṣṭitaḥ || 47 ||

caityakarma na kurvīta na ca pustakavācanam |

% \footnote{Printed caitya karma in \ed}

karotu vācayec cāpi svādhiṣṭhānakrameṇa tu || 48 ||

devān na vandayed evaṃ bhikśūṃś cāpi na vandayet |

athavā vandayet sarvān svādhiṣṭhānakrameṇa tu || 49 ||

mantranyāsaṃ na kurvīta mudrābandhaṃ tathaiva ca |

mantrajāpaṃ na kuryād vā kuryāc ca pratibimbavat || 50 ||

% \footnote{kuryāc ca kuryād vā] \msT, kuryād vā kuryāc ca \ed}

% \footnote{pratibimbavat] \ed, pratibimbat \msT\pcorr, pratimabimbat \msT\acorr}

madīyaṃ dṛśyate cittaṃ bāhyam arthaṃ na vidyate |

% \footnote{bāhyamañcā] \msT\pcorr\ (\textit{secunda manu}), °bāhyam atha \msT\acorr, bāhyam arthaṃ \ed} maybe artho after all...

evaṃ vai bhāvayen māyāṃ tathatām apy anusmaret || 51 ||

% \footnote{vai] \ed, ø \msT}

% \footnote{cāpy] \msT, apy \ed}

anantadhyānavidhinā mantramūrtisamādhinā |

yadi māyā na labdhā syāt sarvabhūmiphalāya vai || 52 ||

dehabhogapratiṣṭhā ca bhūmipāramitādayaḥ |

% \footnote{°pratiṣṭhāna°] \corr, °pratiṣṭāna° \msT, °pratiṣṭhā ca \ed}

% [\msT 4\verso]

buddhaṛddhivikurvādi  sarvaṃ māyāviceṣṭitam || 53 ||

% \footnote{māyā°] \ed, māyāṃ \msT}

ādarśabimbe sakalaṃ sasuyuktaṃ rūpaṃ yathā svacchataraṃ vibhāti |

% \footnote{sakalāṅgayuktaṃ] \msT, sakalaṃ sasuyuktaṃ \ed\emend, sakalaṃ sayuktaṃ \ms}

aśītyanuvyañjanalakṣaṇāḍhyo dehas tathā vajradharaḥ sadaiva || 54 ||

% \footnote{°āḍhyo] \msT\pcorr\ (\textit{secunda manu}) \ed, °āgro \msT\acorr}

indrāyudhaṃ viyati dṛṣṭam anekavarṇaṃ lokasya darśayati karma śubhāni yadvat |

% `here' the readings were completed from the Amṛtakaṇikā, says \ed, but it is not clear without consulting his \ms what he means

% \footnote{viyati] \msT\pcorr\ (\textit{secunda manu}) \ed, viśati \msT\acorr}

% \footnote{śubhādi] \msT, śubhāni \ed}

evaṃ ca vajradhṛg avāpya sitādivarṇaṃ sampādayaty avikalaṃ khalu karma tadvat || 55 ||

% \footnote{vajradhṛg avāpya] \ed, vajradhṛg vāpya \msT\pcorr, vajrag vāpya \msT\acorr}

% \footnote{°varṇaṃ] \ed, °varṇa \msT}

% \footnote{sampādayaty] \msT, [sampā]dayaty \ed}

% \footnote{karma] \msT, [karma] \ed}

% \footnote{tat tat] \conj, ntat \msT, tadvat \ed}

yad dhemarūpyamaṇiśaṅkhaśilāpravālavaidūryatāmrarajatādiṣu saṃsthitaś ca |

% \footnote{ādiṣu saṃsthitaś] \ed, °ādisusaṃsthitaṃ \msT}

tatraika eva hi śaśī gaganodarāntād āvartamānavapuṣā pratibhāti yadvat || 56 ||

% \footnote{tatraika] \ed\emend\msT, tatraiva \ms}

% \footnote{hi] \ed, ø \msT}

% \footnote{gaganodarāntād] \ed\emend, gaganodarāntādy \ms, gaganodarāntādyām \msT}

evaṃ sa nāthaḥ khalu cittavajro nānāvidhas tiṣṭhati jantuvarge |

sa cāpy ayaṃ svātmani viśvarūpo māyāmayo vyāptasamastalokaḥ || 57 ||

% \footnote{cāvyayaḥ] \msT, cāpy ayaṃ \ed}

rūpādipañcakam athāyatanāni yāni aṣṭādaśeti coditāḥ khalu dhātavaś ca |

% \footnote{°pañcakam athā°] \emend, °pañcakamaṃthā° \msT\pcorr, °pañcakamaṃkathā° \msT\acorr}

% \footnote{yāni] \ed, ø \msT} % or my eye-skip>

% \footnote{gaditāḥ] \msT, coditāḥ \ed}

jñānāni pañca viṣayāś ca jagat samastaṃ māyāmayaḥ sa iha vajradharo 'pi nānyat || 58 ||

% \footnote{vajradhṛg eva] \msT, vajradharo 'pi \ed}

% [explicit \msT]

yaṃ parvatā aṣṭamahāsamudrā dvīpāś ca sarve narakādibhedāḥ |

yat sthāvaraṃ jaṅgamam eva dṛṣṭaṃ tat tat svayaṃ sarvavid eva nānyat || 59 ||

evaṃ svacittamayam eva jagat samastaṃ vijñāya mokṣabhavakalpanayā vimuktāḥ |

ye na bhramanti bhavakalpamahārṇaveṣu tebhyo namo 'stv akhilasaṃskṛtapāragebhyaḥ || 60 ||

|| svādhiṣṭhānaprabhedaḥ samāptaḥ | kṛtir iyam āryadevapādānām ||
